    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Mai came sauntering up the steps of Pegasus's castle."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "What’s up? If you guys have enough Star Chips to get into the castle, why're you hangin’ out here?"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "It's Yuge. He lost his chips to Kaiba, and now it's like he's lost the will to go on."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "So the little guy finally lost one, huh? Lucky for you guys that I came by."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Listen up, Yugi. You got beat, but that doesn't mean it's the end of the world."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "When I got beat, I thought it was all over for me too. But then you stepped in and saved my Star Chips! And now, I’m returning the favor!"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "But if you give up your Star Chips, you can't win the prize money!"
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I'm being kind, not stupid."
    },
    {
      "char": "yamibakura",
      "pos": "LEFT_BACK",
      "image": "ryo_surprise",
      "text": "Whoa! She already has ten Chips of her own!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yamibakura",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Go on, Yugi. You know that I owe you, so take them."
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Are my Star Chips not good enough for you? Fine then, I’ll keep them. And your friends can wipe your nose all the way back to the nursery."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Grow up! Sometimes you win and sometimes you lose."
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Mai, don’t get mad. You just don’t understand."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Oh, I understand. Your friend lost one lousy duel and now he’s too chicken to play again. Isn’t that right? How pathetic!"
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "C’mon, Chicken Boy. Duel me for them."
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "I’ll duel you! I’ll duel you right here, right now! For Yugi!"
    }
  ]
